# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# mustr — deploy-time secrets.
#
# The "Deploy to Cloudflare" button reads this file and asks you to fill in
# EACH value during setup (they're all required), so this is kept to only what
# is genuinely needed at deploy time. Everything Discord (client secret, bot
# token) is entered later in the first-run setup wizard and stored in your
# database — so it is intentionally NOT listed here.
#
# For LOCAL development, copy this file to .dev.vars (which is gitignored).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# A long random password YOU invent. It unlocks the one-time setup wizard the
# first time your site loads, so a random passer-by can't claim your site
# before you do. You paste it once in the wizard, then it's done.
# Generate one with:  openssl rand -base64 24
SETUP_TOKEN=

# 32+ random bytes used to sign login/session cookies.
# Generate one with:  openssl rand -base64 32
SESSION_SECRET=
